308.     /**
309.      * Resolve whether a session's model can be shown images, plus the
310.      * provider's vision limits. `modelRef` is the session-config value
311.      * (qualified `provider:model`, bare, or undefined → worker default).
312.      *
313.      * When `opts.sessionId` is given, the catalog is consulted on the SAME
314.      * CopilotClient that serves that session's turns (per-user/system key
315.      * aware) — the only token whose entitlements matter, because it is the
316.      * one the image blobs ride out on. Without a sessionId (tests, generic
317.      * callers) the default-token client is used as before.
318.      *
319.      * `known: false` means the catalog had no entry (BYOK model, catalog
320.      * fetch failure, no usable client, …) — callers must treat that as "no
321.      * vision" and degrade gracefully rather than guessing.
